              {
                "target_type": "term",
                "term_name": "mindmap",
                "comment": "mindmap: tree-structured knowledge system compiling MYCC.md into JSON; append-only patches in .mycc/mindmap-patch.jsonl replayed at load; /mindmap compile preserves MYCC.md-deleted nodes as add patches"
